# Environment variables.
# The catch-all `.env.*` matters more than the specific patterns above it: any copy of
# .env holds live PATs, and this repository's origin is public. Enumerating suffixes
# (.local, .tmp) means the next backup or scratch copy someone makes is tracked by
# default. Sample files are re-admitted explicitly.
.env
.env.*
!.env.sample
!.env.example

backups/
backups/auditgithub_kb_backups_*.json
.backup/

GEMINI.md
global_rules.md
vulnerability_reports/
vulnerability_reports_test/

vulnerability_reports/
vulnerability_reports_test/

# Generated architecture files
generated_architectures/

minikube-darwin-arm64
minikube-darwin-amd64

getleaked/

